WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.500
One line runs through the whole player.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
It stands up into controls when you need them.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
The seek bar is the same line, pulled tight.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
Pull it like a string and let it go.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Then it lies flat again and gets out of the way.
